With the optional `cjk-fallback` Cargo feature, the build additionally
embeds assets fetched by scripts/fetch-cjk-assets.sh from pinned
upstream commits and verified against scripts/cjk-assets.sha256 (not
part of this repository): Noto Sans JP Regular (OFL-1.1) and the Adobe
CMap and mapping resources (BSD-3-Clause). Their licence files are
fetched alongside and must accompany any binary built with that
feature.

